Note: Two face-shaped grids, 'Before Reading Judge' (1-41) and '—and After' (42-86), one clue list; stacked here with a row of blocks between them. Squares outside the faces and the hatched squares are blocks. The two circled squares in the second face (its eyes) are in no entry and are blocks here.

